</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#work">Skip to projects</a><div class="hero-shell"><header class="site-header wrap"><a class="brand" href="#"><span class="monogram">tt.</span><span>Tayyab Tufail<span class="brand-sub">DEVELOPER &amp; AI BUILDER</span></span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">My work</a><a href="#expertise">Expertise</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav><a class="header-contact" href="#contact">Let’s talk <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></header><section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT &amp; INTELLIGENT SYSTEMS</p><h1 id="hero-title">Ideas into<br/>working<br/><span>technology.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">I’m Tayyab Tufail. I build apps, websites, AI models, and robotics systems — connecting thoughtful software with practical problem-solving.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="#work" class="button button-lime">Explore my work <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:tayyabmalik1655@gmail.com">Get in touch <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="hero-showcase"><div class="showcase-top"><span><i></i> PROJECT SPOTLIGHT</span><span>01 / ROBOTICS</span></div><div class="showcase-image"><img src="/images/medbot-hospital-overview.png" alt="MedBot simulated hospital with pharmacy, patient rooms, and charging base"/></div><div class="showcase-caption"><div><span class="eyebrow">LANGUAGE → PLANNING → ACTION</span><h2>Meet MedBot.</h2><p>Natural language. Autonomous navigation.</p></div><a href="#project-medbot" class="circle-link" aria-label="Explore MedBot and other projects"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="showcase-footer"><span>PYTHON</span><span>TRANSFORMERS</span><span>WEBOTS</span></div></div></section><div class="discipline-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>Web development</span><i>✳</i><span>Mobile apps</span><i>✳</i><span>AI &amp; machine learning</span><i>✳</i><span>Robotics</span><i>✳</i><span>IT solutions</span></div></div></div><main><section id="work" class="work-section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE PORTFOLIO</p><h2>Built to solve.<br/><span>Made to work.</span></h2></div><p>Applications, experiments, and intelligent systems. A closer look at the work, the thinking, and the results.</p></div><div class="collection-label"><span>PROJECT COLLECTION</span><span>15 projects · Apps, web, AI &amp; robotics</span></div><div class="project-grid"><article class="project-card" id="project-api-test-lab"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/api-test-lab-workspace.png" alt="API Test Evidence Lab interface, captured from the local application." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">01</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">Web / Developer tools</p><h3>API Test Evidence Lab</h3><p>From an OpenAPI specification to AI-assisted tests and traceable execution reports.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>React</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>FastAPI</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tgsti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->API Test Evidence Lab</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-medbot"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/medbot-hospital-overview.png" alt="The simulated hospital: pharmacy, patient rooms, reception, and charging base." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">02</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Robotics</p><h3>MedBot</h3><p>Natural-language understanding meets autonomous hospital delivery in simulation.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>Python</span><span>DistilBERT</span><span>Webots</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3thcti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->MedBot</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-asaan-mazdoor"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/asaan-mazdoor-original-presentation.png" alt="Original project presentation featuring the Asaan Mazdoor welcome screen." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">03</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">Mobile / Full-stack</p><h3>Asaan Mazdoor</h3><p>A service marketplace connecting customers with professionals and everyday work.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>React Native</span><span>Expo</span><span>Express</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3thsti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Asaan Mazdoor</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-fire-smoke"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/fire-smoke-inference-output.jpg" alt="Annotated smoke prediction saved by the Gradio inference application." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">04</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Computer vision</p><h3>Fire &amp; Smoke Detection</h3><p>Image and video detection with a usable interface and a comparative model study.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>YOLOv8</span><span>PyTorch</span><span>OpenCV</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3ticti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Fire &amp; Smoke Detection</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-weapon-detection"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/weapon-detection-predictions.jpg" alt="Saved validation predictions with pistol and knife labels and confidence scores." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">05</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">Web / Computer vision</p><h3>Weapon Detection Console</h3><p>A detection and analytics interface for pistol and knife image/video analysis.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>React</span><span>FastAPI</span><span>YOLOv8</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tisti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Weapon Detection Console</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-finbias"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/finbias-test-confusion-matrix.png" alt="FinBERT held-out sentiment classification results." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">06</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Natural language</p><h3>FinBias Sentiment Analyzer</h3><p>Financial sentiment classification with a local interface and explainable model results.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>FinBERT</span><span>Transformers</span><span>PyTorch</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tjcti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->FinBias Sentiment Analyzer</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-brain-mri"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/brain-mri-dataset-samples.png" alt="MRI dataset samples across the four classification categories." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">07</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Deep learning</p><h3>Brain MRI Classification</h3><p>A four-class MRI study comparing a custom TumorDetNet model with a baseline CNN.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>PyTorch</span><span>Python</span><span>CNN</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tjsti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Brain MRI Classification</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-grocery"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/grocery-dataset-samples.png" alt="Sample produce and packaged-product images from the grocery dataset." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">08</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Computer vision</p><h3>Grocery Item Recognition</h3><p>Recognizing 43 grocery categories with model comparisons and top-five predictions.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>EfficientNet</span><span>PyTorch</span><span>Gradio</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tkcti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Grocery Item Recognition</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-phishing"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/phishing-final-holdout.png" alt="Final reduced-feature XGBoost holdout confusion matrix." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">09</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Cybersecurity</p><h3>Explainable Phishing Detection</h3><p>A feature-based phishing study with explainability and careful holdout evaluation.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>XGBoost</span><span>scikit-learn</span><span>SHAP</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tksti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Explainable Phishing Detection</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-gesture-robot"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/gesture-robot-navigation.jpg" alt="Recorded e-puck waypoint-navigation simulation." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">10</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">Robotics / Human interaction</p><h3>Voice &amp; Gesture Robot Control</h3><p>Local voice commands and head gestures for confirmed waypoint navigation.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>MediaPipe</span><span>Vosk</span><span>OpenCV</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tlcti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Voice &amp; Gesture Robot Control</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-autonomous-robot"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/autonomous-robot-navigation.jpg" alt="Completed-lap evidence from the retained proposal validation world." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">11</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">Robotics / Computer vision</p><h3>Vision-Based Autonomous E-puck</h3><p>Camera-based lane following with obstacle tracking and local proximity-sensor safety.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>OpenCV</span><span>Webots</span><span>Python</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tlsti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Vision-Based Autonomous E-puck</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-toxicity"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/toxicity-dataset-categories.png" alt="Distribution of the ten dataset categories." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">12</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Natural language</p><h3>Transformer Toxicity Classification</h3><p>A ten-category text-classification study spanning dataset preparation and transformer comparison.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>BERT</span><span>DistilBERT</span><span>DeBERTa</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tmcti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Transformer Toxicity Classification</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-water-potability"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/water-potability-test-results.png" alt="Random forest test results at the selected threshold of 0.46." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">13</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">AI / Data science</p><h3>Water Potability Prediction</h3><p>A comparative tabular-ML study with reusable pipelines and transparent model evaluation.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>scikit-learn</span><span>Random Forest</span><span>pandas</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tmsti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Water Potability Prediction</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-food-app"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/food-app-welcome.png" alt="The original Food Hunt welcome screen, captured from the app’s local web preview." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">14</span></div><div class="project-body"><p class="eyebrow">Mobile / UI development</p><h3>Food Ordering App</h3><p>A mobile ordering experience with menu browsing, search, and cart management.</p><div class="tech-tags"><span>React Native</span><span>Expo</span><span>Redux</span></div><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3tncti_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-slot="dialog-trigger" class="case-study-trigger">View project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Food Ordering App</span></button></div></article><article class="project-card" id="project-cybershield"><div class="project-visual"><img src="/images/cybershield-login.png" alt="The original CyberShield login interface, rendered in an isolated web preview." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="project-number">15